{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Misaki, a young girl, moves to the rural town where her grandmother lives.</strong><br>As her new life begins, she is drawn into the town\u2019s long\u2011standing <i>Flower Festival</i>.<br>On the day of the festival, before she realizes it, Misaki has wandered into a sinister otherworld known as the <strong>\u201cIn\u2011Between.\u201d</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As everyday life warps and an eerie presence spreads through the town, Misaki roams in search of a way back to her original world.<br>Flight and exploration, choices and discovery\u2014by collecting hidden items and fragments of memory scattered around the town, she forges ahead through a world steeped in fear and mystery.<br>Which path to take is up to the player. <strong>Your choices will greatly change how the story ends.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An exploration\u2011driven adventure set in a disturbing residential neighborhood</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chase action that lets you feel the looming terror with simple controls</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Branching narrative shaped by item collection and player choice</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A multi\u2011ending system playable in short sessions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Delicate, beautiful pixel\u2011art characters with maps rendered in 3D CG</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a town where the otherworld and reality intersect, a story filled with truth and terror begins.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Game Start!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3332140/b35fbe70697383c716ffa90d96c38c6129b1445c.jpg"},{"name":"A New Dawn","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3332140/0871a9115fc1a037c2b18af607d648b4f88277f6.jpg"},{"name":"Indomitable Spirit","path"